; REFAC-104: `sol_cli` is the umbrella over the domain libraries in the
; subdirectories, so its consumers (cli/bin, cli/test, fixtures) are unchanged.
; Each domain is a (wrapped false) library: no module is renamed, but a module can
; only reference a domain its own dune lists, so the boundaries are enforced at
; build time. See internal/pipeline/tickets/DONE/REFAC-104.md for the graph.

(library
 (name sol_cli)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules)
 (libraries
  sol_cli_base
  sol_cli_kube
  sol_cli_workspace
  sol_cli_cloud
  sol_cli_deploy
  sol_cli_local))
